 <name>MComix</name>
 <summary>Comic and general purpose image viewer</summary>
 <description>
  <p>
	  MComix is a user-friendly, customizable image viewer. It is specifically
	  designed to handle comic books (both Western comics and manga) and supports
	  a variety of container formats (including CBR, CBZ, CB7, CBT, LHA, PDF and AZW3).
  </p>
  <p>
	  MComix is a fork of the Comix project, and aims to add bug fixes and
	  stability improvements after Comix development came to a halt in
	  late 2009.
  </p>
 </description>

